# Quarto generates docs/site_libs/ (~1.1 MB of Bootstrap, search and nav assets),
# but every page here sets `embed-resources: true`, so all of it is inlined and
# nothing references the directory. If a page ever drops embed-resources it will
# start needing these files, and this line has to go with it.
docs/site_libs/
